you may try this [work-around](https://stackoverflow.com/a/75939304) for importing @gradio/client in commonjs module (e.g. nestjs app)
this works for me:
```ts
export const importDynamic = new Function('modulePath', 'return import(modulePath)');

const { client } = await importDynamic('@gradio/client');
```

